evention of these infections within hospitals.", "BURNS:Burns refer to injuries caused by heat, chemicals, electricity, or radiation, leading to damage to the skin and other tissues, often requiring specialized nutritional management for recovery.", "DENT DL:Dent DL is a researcher involved in studies related to immunonutrition and its effects on critically ill patients, including those with burns.", "J TRAUMA:J Trauma is a medical journal that focuses on publishing research related to trauma and emergency medicine. It encompasses a wide range of topics within trauma care, including studies on enteral feeding and burn injuries. The journal serves as a platform for disseminating important findings and advancements in the field of trauma care, contributing to the ongoing development of best practices in emergency medicine.", "J TRACE ELEM MED BIOL:J Trace Elem Med Biol is a journal focusing on trace elements in medicine and biology.", "J BURN CARE RES:J Burn Care Res is a journal dedicated to research on burn care and rehabilitation.", "J HUM NUTR DIET:J Hum Nutr Diet is a journal that focuses on human nutrition and dietetics.", "PHARMACOTHERAPY:Pharmacotherapy is a journal dedicated to the study of drug therapy and its effects. It serves as a platform for research and discussions related to the various aspects of pharmacological treatments.", "NUTRICIÓN EN LA ENFERMEDAD TRAUMÁTICA:A significant event discussing nutrition in traumatic conditions and critically burned patients.", "GUIDELINES FOR SPECIALIZED NUTRITIONAL SUPPORT:An event that outlines guidelines for nutritional and metabolic support in critically ill patients.", "SELEEN IN CRITICALLY ILL PATIENTS:A study focusing on the role of selenium in critically ill patients with systemic inflammatory response.", "OXANDROLONE TREATMENT:A treatment event involving the use of oxandrolone in adults with severe thermal injury.", "EARLY ENTERAL NUTRITION:A systematic review event comparing early versus late enteral nutritional support in burn injury."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}